{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_3_10012_01",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:48f3afd199d3e7dea99928789b60134f60721780725733de9e1bbef1e2ac3868",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:98ae2259e9eabc11379ecffd59a8f8a25bd4a63d7eb0ca0254e78b73ec25075e",
      "text": "Life is beautiful！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3bce3714a8880287aaaa1e902eee8d06c62fd3be954d8804570478b375841fac",
      "text": "S.E.M的三人决定在大学的校园开放日上\n举行现场演出。\n组合中最年轻的类，\n提出了各种为了与台下学生融为一体的\n点子。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_a:cmd-000011:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6bd711a0c587f0c078d13f61396e0634340adf4afbcabad0ac20aea8f2b2a191",
      "text": "序章",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_a:cmd-000011:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:98ae2259e9eabc11379ecffd59a8f8a25bd4a63d7eb0ca0254e78b73ec25075e",
      "text": "Life is beautiful！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_a:cmd-000020:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cbd5792d93a08ffb8e71d3111992edffe857d3f4833152ce3ec39af0a76a7fb5",
      "text": "类的家中",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_a:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f3395a8cb7b918383cf0369ecd5c205c6b1acc8e3221e023e9a4b11eb9078872",
      "text": "哼哼，哼哼～♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_a:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:955ad1385813ca1f8652cb35643e3768a85270ce5a6a0278dbde3bbf90099200",
      "text": "嗯～……已经这个时间了啊。差不多该为了明天的\n碰头会check一下资料了吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_a:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9e1840fe95a124b25404f9758d176748f89b78c39a8cbc765ca8278e245acd99",
      "text": "（下次的工作是大学的校园开放日！\n在Students面前live，真令人期待呢♪）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_a:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d640f8f5c9ddcde98e5c6e25071bc8e2bb53d5aef5459bb0ef95cdf6a8f8d457",
      "text": "话说，我直到前阵子也还是个大学生来着……啊。\n不知怎的，突然好想翻翻以前的照片！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_a:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c764ba68218f31ec2f578f8cca1ad51cbc25649314adc0a811711d5abb26ac01",
      "text": "这家cafe，真怀念啊～\n是大家一起复习期末考试时的照片呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_a:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:023719a51aacd2ee2c890f594f09af8684cef904b65bbc837b9fee4e949fe3b9",
      "text": "这张是……\n网球社团一起去的野营！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_a:cmd-000085:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ef411b6ccd825834c3d01378f64333ebe2b8459180cc0a321380a85bb6372ca6",
      "text": "晚上BBQ还玩了试胆大会，\n可热闹了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_a:cmd-000093:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e0533bed34b3e7981c494d7b497d2235cc5b133334a826c9ced8c2c422b70e5d",
      "text": "（呵呵，全是些开心的事情啊）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_a:cmd-000102:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dfe40e6a7fea5ea88ca07bb8d56c51e11defeefdcc33fc5fec94ec5f5d31b1de",
      "text": "但是……当了偶像之后再去大学，\n会是怎样的心情呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_a:cmd-000110:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b9538fba2b5ab1a779f2d38d83f1b4bbb7e8e028cffa4d4753eba5eef1b31d12",
      "text": "感觉又能发现全新的“开心”呢☆",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_b:cmd-000020:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:45a2639bee133f79fa257c83a1284145a61c3e0a2c5692309a6e2fb52ad44dc9",
      "text": "练习室",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_b:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:daa06e6bf511ef603c6faa12dd3a8d05f3faf4863f19e779cfe9b37ffc7f5896",
      "text": "……那么，先在这里休息一下吧！\n各自好好补充水分哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_b:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b10ce3b848ec8d9245443aa6c135605d93261d3a0fda3ab9e18e7f1ebf262a98",
      "text": "了解。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_b:cmd-000079:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:90a6d9f8ac93d41ae46200f74e5fa66c8b2d2bdf74ae48965c0c9a843d109700",
      "text": "休息区",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_b:cmd-000100:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:84380a8c0fe8076c5d8b26dea1b8646ad232332c51c2ed50c13c0988ed78bd96",
      "text": "哎呀～，好嘞……大叔我的\n脑子和身体要记新歌可太吃力了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_b:cmd-000116:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a9ac859109c3f6f5292a3e92f66726af3245c2add3d5659d3d5df993a7ff68c4",
      "text": "真羡慕年轻水灵的类啊……不如说类的话，\n不站在舞台上而是坐在观众席里也毫无违和感吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_b:cmd-000122:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b0f6413dd077dd2240d7d237facaa4a80e8d33dac63893eb2e42917533c81f19",
      "text": "啊哈！毕竟我直到最近都还是大学生嘛☆",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_b:cmd-000132:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:066b40942d7d939ae75f5258ac21a4c70f25e56afece5b28557da5b0c49b43ff",
      "text": "说起来，\nMr.们以前是怎样的大学生啊？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_b:cmd-000140:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:27b377d90860ee77b80d858b6cd1b12e3319d1edb656cada34d89d963a14dfc0",
      "text": "前几天我翻了翻自己的旧照片，\n发现我和现在其实没怎么变呢～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_b:cmd-000148:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5f21c8df8aa775187b573d9939ab735ff643429a4f8004c2203e367fdd21ed71",
      "text": "嗯，应该是吧。\n要是完全不一样那才吓人呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_b:cmd-000154:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:81f030d0eda0d764b164c5faf1d8361786f8ef7f7f34b3f09f2edeec0c34e89c",
      "text": "是啊……我也和现在没什么两样。\n当年也是每天都勤勉向学。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_b:cmd-000161:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5b265604bb1e7f02e5960c0c1f2268c7bca6ba56b2bb2c06947f39636a4f1c5e",
      "text": "……我也差不多吧，很忙这点是一样的。\n搞搞研究写写论文什么的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_b:cmd-000171:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bdcda45f2f5b923eab48af28d1b0770917431ab8c66f2b81c6b53fefcafe3243",
      "text": "类呢？想必过得很enjoy吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_c:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:accd8864594317d68f549d0f6a2475d117e690c5dbfd9e705f2af63ac0c49d4a",
      "text": "Of course！\n和Friends玩了个痛快哦☆也许正因如此？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_c:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d528c28f33ec283d99a340afc76a884e1bc50139e95943f36ea7c1e9d7e9053e",
      "text": "当我说出“要去当Teacher”的时候，\n大家都大吃一惊呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_c:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:766b3a10f7c714d69d27538760d1b24fde61c0da2c6f491bfc5952c7a6028d38",
      "text": "“还以为舞田会去大众传媒之类、\n更光鲜亮丽的行业呢！”这样。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_c:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:26b18b18aca5e90c7fcc6e93b3ad584a9ae22923fa153a7015f10b3cd1345dce",
      "text": "啊——大众传媒吗。我懂。\n类只要站在那里就很有光彩嘛……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_c:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ac7720aba195397a1c2407a0096f6522840fc9b9abcbeef33896f9f39f817de7",
      "text": "毕竟性格开朗又善于社交，\n朋友会这么想也不足为奇。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_c:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6794a159b4abfb69e5131387239aa11d9bf5b56cb7751b1f41b47b8894afd6ea",
      "text": "嗯～大众传媒听起来也挺好玩的，\n不过人生果然还是稳定更重要对吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_c:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0078fa104c8c9d78b30d470a7c829a145c51936e7ddcf7f916660537ed3f11ff",
      "text": "而且，我觉得这是活用教师资格证的chance！\n感到超级兴奋呢☆",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_c:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a5184645398415dcac96a6a4838d15ff20bc618a0fa47315e9134fa25ce7f0af",
      "text": "可是后来，却凭着一时兴起转职成了这么像赌博的职业。\n果然还是太胡来了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_c:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9752defd8cbb077da30196b16d298fbb5cae1c2debcff7908f150d057747fc7f",
      "text": "啊哈哈！因为当时那种兴奋，\n跟想到当teacher这条路时一模一样嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_c:cmd-000092:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3abb767509d52d1eda1d48ad0cef6ae9b7aa0ab8595dc906c869e0fbe25b05b8",
      "text": "正如想象的那样……不，远超想象。\n偶像这份工作，超interesting！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_c:cmd-000102:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:539bfe1e63fd3aa088435882fde012f032b575c217b692f14bf608538536c1f9",
      "text": "那时候能跟着Mr. 硲一起走真是太好啦☆",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_c:cmd-000125:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:91884ee995d1099684938f8b2a3cdf874c9c17849d13d579a137ebfbc5853f3f",
      "text": "喂喂，●●●●プロデューサー。\n没能及时注意到你的来电，抱歉。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_c:cmd-000127:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2fe9cb226fc186a04e1bfc23c5f6b0a2348875da1270f57ecd349e1aa99d7dbc",
      "text": "这边的事情已经办完了，现在可以通话。\n有什么事情吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_c:cmd-000129:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d3b112a5c1495e4a70ea8a2d69074fbe82b723ae8b67a405ddde449645e34596",
      "text": "关于这次的工作，\n对方有些话想说……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_c:cmd-000132:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3111fa7b2403afcdedf3ceb0a6809f4997721065acb133100ce3560209ad2000",
      "text": "嗯。听起来像是有什么紧急情况啊。\n我知道了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_c:cmd-000134:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9c18f5f377aa0f54ccb445bcba57f7601abe866de65f4e931d2a824dc476e8c9",
      "text": "舞田君和山下君那边由我来转达。\n我们三个人这就马上赶往事务所。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_c:cmd-000136:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6ca11917a702b88035ec3829b40cd0ab84be8f21339da9250e9b2d92ce75e051",
      "text": "那么，稍后见。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_d:cmd-000019:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1eea9209ae61a248f2bd6f46aea08ac935ef602ada12aa5aaf51c50ec487fb6a",
      "text": "事务所·会议室",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_d:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:395e1e0587dd4b9f9651c99d8688715f896c700b3636d0c7194d15a0e800904d",
      "text": "…………",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_d:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:395e1e0587dd4b9f9651c99d8688715f896c700b3636d0c7194d15a0e800904d",
      "text": "…………",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_d:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ff36c49083e7151439ce190dac8e100036a41475549010c262208e1cb21ff7ab",
      "text": "（气氛好heavy啊。而且，实行委员会的孩子们\n表情好难过……怎么了吗？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_d:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:44bb91e7ec48caf3f814508f77e62bbb52c71d751d627f7673cf6f2a23421bc9",
      "text": "……我们想说的事情，没有别的。\n希望能撤回这次的委托。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_d:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9fb786e4c682b0cbcf6de7b8872e83a410aa451469c59ffd489c2a4cc68b5766",
      "text": "能否向我们说明一下\n具体的情况呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_d:cmd-000086:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:25e518bb7301651e3bf04b5c87359e0c26a922eaaedcf5f403693a69798155a0",
      "text": "这个嘛……不，总之，\n就当那次委托没有发生过吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_d:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c8128f814077850608c62b9d036e76acbd4c98488886badbb3898252ce5430be",
      "text": "详细的说明，改日\n由大学事务局以书面文件之类的方式发送……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_d:cmd-000091:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e944dbcb2552d9c6235fe4d7f8f2b24fef93b30d2953a7df47f56fd744705f53",
      "text": "老师，我们还是无法接受！开放日有\n偶像要来，现在可是非常有话题度的啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_d:cmd-000093:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7f5589d05aa1112e64dd644b037535c5e9101af248eb44fcb0e5e1094a3700f6",
      "text": "肯定能创下历届最高到场人数的。\n而且，肯定会像过节一样热闹的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_d:cmd-000101:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5ee77a41af67f6917ae8b265495fdca04e3cd63a04981f27f686ba7c5b46efd1",
      "text": "参观者自然会变多吧。\n但是，你们作为学生的本分是什么？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_d:cmd-000105:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f53373267723087bc5bdb806e73a29d664d601713f31d396a5a97111af48c2cd",
      "text": "我校不需要心浮气躁、\n抱着玩乐心态来的人。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_d:cmd-000111:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e25e3d8f097debfe6b287a58a55870ffaceb92d9a80a4d8080a304ef26783431",
      "text": "应该聚集的是认真思考自己的人生、\n严格求学切磋磨砺的同志。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_d:cmd-000118:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c14abf8627cda570b486e4d453d2473bbe424b6c9f418632c633ccdbead47a55",
      "text": "Umm……快乐的心情，难道是那么坏的事吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_d:cmd-000123:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:586c910ff022edf488b4db6c2fd944ef080e9d5b19ab17e2f5e9466bfcc585a3",
      "text": "我觉得，那是人生中至关重要的partner哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_e:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5492c14d87fe785ea4e1e33a096cba3c3c49faffcf79d3868d6a5499d2b57248",
      "text": "毕竟，快乐的friend、event、music、fashion……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_e:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:98f60d036f908283e1d44da9be9f4e93cf7db089cca0f931d08cbaa714a4e66e",
      "text": "只要与各种各样的“快乐”手牵手，\n世界就会变得越来越KIRAKIRA闪耀哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_e:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:616e67dae92368bb52d859512def0c839f2d61059b1accef2cdcc18b99e3a703",
      "text": "……为了得到那份“快乐”，\n意外地也需要付出努力就是了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_e:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9c6552fdd517a03cafc04ba86fe9fe574dd61ff09e2c2bb19728b04a8cda099a",
      "text": "偶像看起来总是笑眯眯地很开心，\n其实在幕后可是累得直喘粗气的哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_e:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ee2926f5f03e5e3aa37912152795d47d6b295cb8b4ffdf34f5d8774baa71a596",
      "text": "我们所有人，直到不久前\n都还在当教师……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_e:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:452e7bd372424ee4d170d9182101c9cccf0d757828bab49793a090f05363f90a",
      "text": "如果有孩子看着我们，觉得当偶像真好、也想当\n偶像！……要是有人这么想的话。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_e:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4e151017f4a1283f3f29e504eeaa1503834c8ff3734217996e8a668ae873025a",
      "text": "甚至会让人想抓着他的肩膀说：从现在开始好好学习各种知识吧，连以前当过老师的人都是这么想的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_e:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:41cbb359920410f66e8e86224f9d6ca63d05075fbfed9fec87da187dd74c0fbc",
      "text": "我们是为了向年轻一代传达求学的重要性，\n才进行偶像活动的。也就是说……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_e:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:800808ab9cc5d83e09deffab4bea8015bc0014f7e25c1c8b8f5bff487c5cc595",
      "text": "我们怀着与您相近的心意，\n站在舞台上。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_e:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f71c8fd4f4770b122c73a07c0e1a6e966eec52f2a3e49aca5af63d45e11cc919",
      "text": "和讲课相比，偶像的舞台\n或许确实会被人当作玩乐和余兴。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_e:cmd-000085:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2e657a7f1466f2014de1fab7c1dc5d71d4cf62a626cb0fe793d17815ee7fe3a9",
      "text": "但是，无论态度是严肃还是享乐，学生以\n怎样的姿态获取学识，应该不是问题所在。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_e:cmd-000111:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f4e031d22c8ef4c2099dc21e301c971271537e47ffce9f9a8897a11ab248329a",
      "text": "我们要在舞台上，用歌声与舞蹈。\n引导学生们走向光辉灿烂的未来。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_e:cmd-000124:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e14aef2808a9917af7d40055ee550b85c8030a7d505b9bab41b8ad35fada40c6",
      "text": "对对♪所以说，no problem啦！\n我们为了大家，每天都在好好lesson呢☆",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_e:cmd-000129:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:982917a30cdf7a141e3fd84db1ce25b7226f6e01c0d01216b7e00537a296af78",
      "text": "能让身为前教师的成年人也获得成长的、\n属于偶像世界的惊人魅力，以及……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_e:cmd-000131:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ea3880d284de80c45ad031dd6f6bfbd7269ac7319c03619f411cce5aba66f859",
      "text": "S.E.M为了大家不断磨砺练习的实力，\n在当天的舞台上，绝对会展现给各位看的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_e:cmd-000142:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:18a1fdb01383e84d0dcf8ff877640686e368358256b6820d7fc1a244a5a587d5",
      "text": "请务必，像原定计划那样交由S.E.M负责吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_f:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:630a1cc8cd01c9a625f68e7dc7a44919370268d3ebd90f500adb1e1576ad8577",
      "text": "呼——总算勉强避免了被撤回的结局？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_f:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:61b86b5db1412b38dd684144dd1124ea1577794ceec92efbf77b50cb5d66298d",
      "text": "是的。虽然对方说会再联络，\n但看商谈结束时的那个样子……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_f:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d9a05dc3d50a9abfcac444921b3f1f7e48a734144fa2f482b55a31c52d5eb3f9",
      "text": "All right！肯定会让我们站上舞台的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_f:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:01fd6d257df99f1143a163785bea698ac09a5d708c3e570d6a05cc9aad8e7ba7",
      "text": "毕竟，●●●●プロデューサー酱，\n那么用力地为我们push了一把嘛！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_f:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:30c644f4881cd82f571bda5941bec65348678bddf31f5aabe149ade17804e883",
      "text": "嗯。……谢谢你相信我们，\n●●●●プロデューサー。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_f:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:13b74203c12bf883f314cdc1162db2cfbc9ba23c2fb9f3697beb1206dc43518a",
      "text": "正是因为始终有你的支持，\n引导年轻一代的愿望才得以不断实现。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_f:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cd07f9148e1886c301c170e61b95f32d935b7b1530b640be6d56d68125a1156c",
      "text": "今后也拜托你了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_f:cmd-000085:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e6dc9d37471b5aec2ac5d18dbef6f6f79dc46d4305e967538fec35768d176725",
      "text": "那么，虽然气氛搞得像已经干完了一桩大事似的……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_f:cmd-000092:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:249371fed81c9236f6896fa575fe881697af2f934e1b28a022ba51e517118971",
      "text": "为了必将到来的正式演出，\n今天也继续开碰头会和练习吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_f:cmd-000098:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:71044c344240f1db2b2225309913497151ca513caf7849e099291536daccbf96",
      "text": "说起来，舞田君。你昨天说为了炒热舞台气氛\n有了新的点子……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_f:cmd-000103:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8d00baa04ba4b2a098589dd1ab697ea00e5f2d5b7044536ddc0b5ce4b60def6d",
      "text": "对对！\n这次的客人，理所当然有很多student对吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_f:cmd-000115:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3f02f02af77910c1ef28c9a98d7c14f757f2ace018ebbfd4078b9473ae3fac11",
      "text": "所以……为了和大家一起嗨起来，\nMr.们也变成student的心情吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_g:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8fa5eefd37ecdb4c517158519c6d89a9037e30446732aec14c033f0cc098ee62",
      "text": "那么，点子其一！\n穿上学生时代的校服，3个人一起逛主题乐园☆",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_g:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1c3345451bff32e35cfcf0012f6144a2580d05a23bf7ea5adc0f17299c6ef65a",
      "text": "在当年的同一个spot摆出同一个pose拍照也很棒呢。\n当时的心情就会苏醒过来哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_g:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2baa4254ba7a0a562456da51f025b0d0b4cff224f9ff0773699c7bd313417328",
      "text": "看，我当年就是这样和friends一起拍的哦～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_g:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4585cefbc2a60a895e31ec797ba250ae3cd237971624e8a5560fbf3ac8fff8f7",
      "text": "啊，这张是路过的人\n顺便一起合照的照片呢☆",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_g:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d02ebc1f0eb08daee8ec7f313d8e6d370399d459e40d30359fcf5791e7fe6174",
      "text": "唔。看起来感情非常要好，\n居然是当时偶遇的路人吗……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_g:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5bab2324631da5e73e6e7e09ee6a592b24cf6678e7a6d703ce362b78a3936ee5",
      "text": "这么闪耀的记忆，能从我脑子里苏醒吗。\n感觉怎么呼唤都不会有反应吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_g:cmd-000091:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c67e60a21e409462956d2cd6446e1ef177f2d5e4afb94db95d58c90f261e1e94",
      "text": "不过嘛，正如类所说，\n去融入学生的生活或者说那种氛围是很重要的呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_g:cmd-000097:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f46bed98a13174fa056ae823bb8c251bf042c8abf21ec7404145a172040df854",
      "text": "说起来，High×Joker的孩子们也\n经常拍这样的照片或视频呢……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_g:cmd-000102:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9d9fbaeb7ae1a8b572f0d03f2c118eaf533dc508ca743b39b6428296515ac9cd",
      "text": "果然年轻人，心底还是会被\n热热闹闹欢腾的气氛所吸引吧～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_g:cmd-000118:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bcc426f83d1ea7fe0948090006a6e61110221285244b2f0053270b689540fd98",
      "text": "于是，这就是下一个点子了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_g:cmd-000123:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a7ef53b177a2b614a8878f804191067d20af88580bb0ba84c2d0124434928725",
      "text": "为了营造出WAIWAI mood，\n和大家打成一片……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_g:cmd-000127:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:22d32fbcaa5a373b857ff5d6c205743d70dbb24e761481cdf84c9924cdf1cad7",
      "text": "让S.E.M和students一起跳同一套编舞，\n这个想法怎么样？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_h:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1d63c1cc5ba27206bc924b02f2bacb74a46f7aebe1689f73282c58a5ce4c03cf",
      "text": "这次是转身！\n举起双手，跳起来～……♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_h:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:45e28d84ce48a8f5c1c9d428bac6558ff4d743ee11176a6fc2cd1eeef4425188",
      "text": "就像这样把视频上传上去。发了之后……\n看，look at this！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_h:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bc63cac97dfc1a7318853c60597e9cbb50c5d89d24541a7916d07901c4d130ff",
      "text": "哦～。模仿着跳跳看的人，居然有这么多啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_h:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:08a51b3ceeb2226e9a4cba6107938ae4013c3b450eb869091031449e29786586",
      "text": "还有人不按示范，\n加入了自己的创意呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_h:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:68e02970ecf72656288a4a0e4dd0f1e6f3ccec0db79a1d381b24ca2d0f7b9fea",
      "text": "我们也把新歌的编舞录下来上传吧！\n稍微arrange一下，改成容易记住的版本。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_h:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:884e56db4f86f517c2c9ad77e1cfe694b27306501908b4ac77644c4a88bb8b77",
      "text": "只要和大家融为一体去dance，\n全场所有人的heart一定能紧紧相连的☆",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_h:cmd-000097:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a62e21d0b95dafe4b739391311cb607a14a8aa8e67372aceebe6a1032a5a32c1",
      "text": "……非常出色的点子，舞田君！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_h:cmd-000111:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7f4a696dcea8c924c57bc228449a58ac1bd07fd2f3b6dd35693a2815cd4523cb",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー。\n能拜托你立刻开始筹备吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_h:cmd-000115:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:013bfe1818640c825dfd4a5144ca965fe8378c064ebcbf5a3ecb810d5b3a9c4e",
      "text": "当然可以！\n我会推进各方确认和拍摄准备的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_h:cmd-000135:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bc675c569f00af8edca31a7841fb0ea38b86ff179ba818a7867939ead0f04191",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー酱！那个呢，我的\nfriend里，有个很懂这种genre的孩子哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_h:cmd-000141:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:73923b8c768a32ecb4218de40c29c706fe6340845c42728c836bc3954cf76e74",
      "text": "我明天去向他要点视频方面的advice！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_i:cmd-000014:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "几天后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_i:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2541127cfc82fbafd4d9f6e50113e2f6258b2ffa5a6f08513fd8bd0529ab6c51",
      "text": "Good morning，\n●●●●プロデューサー酱～……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_i:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9cdef640f67e6eb5381c29e6cd40ec8fbedb62e4648088328cef4e1b9e5f2a95",
      "text": "类先生，今天来得真早啊！\n而且……总觉得没什么精神呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_i:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:12d6ed9dd4498ca7b37d648ebdf1b9eb70f6150e4296adbfa1bfb0c8801255da",
      "text": "那个，我是不是……\n给大伙添麻烦了啊？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_i:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b2faff3da587ad3264fa7dfdc64af23c1a08270b027c925860cc8ac20d642734",
      "text": "昨天，因为那个视频的事情，\n我和大学时代的friend做了个talk。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_i:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fb6073971ebdaec238488683dd26e0c006df6793c15083f8c3a62bf311eac4b6",
      "text": "我聊得超级开心，气氛很热烈……\n结果对方说，舞田还是一如既往那么随心所欲啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_i:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:954b1b358b4f070f2beedb601a948560d5305ea747ccfe7e0a99199821d35da2",
      "text": "还说事务所的人被你耍得团团转，\n肯定很辛苦吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_i:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7647e4782c63f6779ce3a3c6b387fad17b72d2f5a48e2f95e2a8595f77dc6e3f",
      "text": "我……有时自己也会在意，\n和周围相比自己是不是太不合群了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_i:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:132eabdf171c69ad2b7395d18cddfddb0e444c5bceaa604923a9de47f93e3fb1",
      "text": "……你怎么觉得呢？\nMr.们，心里又是怎么想的呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_i:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1440c507260400bb39768f17521372ae168a23fbc578e7c46583213c29fcb22a",
      "text": "……昨天，道夫先生不是说过了吗？\n“非常出色的点子，舞田君！”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_i:cmd-000097:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:034f000cc56d361748db5f69d117d5c6b031b1fc946b64d7610990ba341f9bd8",
      "text": "类先生的奇思妙想与独特风格，\n拥有着独一无二的光芒哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_i:cmd-000100:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:baf2138abf72171f8cd1649865455f62b927056b48e68b2b3a3ecffbd1e87260",
      "text": "环顾全世界，也是无可替代的光芒。\n在他们两位眼中，肯定也是如此！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_i:cmd-000106:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:860bdd50e55b58125078b046c7534d3114616ca25f59a7ed53153d44206742ad",
      "text": "……这样啊。\n我原来既unique……又是不可或缺的啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_i:cmd-000111:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:196659b0874c372b7bddb605c7b96c52aa77196632cd0dc32c64005bd046cfa0",
      "text": "Thanks a lot，●●●●プロデューサー酱！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_i:cmd-000118:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b9596359d856c87b4cfdf9616142fb3045dbaeb7e572af7c308ee702091fa820",
      "text": "我心里现在被深爱着自己的心情\n填得满满的了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_i:cmd-000124:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d5355077c0a39716cc9dbdd193e6762b96df14623f5721a577047a321aa8394b",
      "text": "只要有你和Mr.们的力量，\n我感觉无论发生什么都能保持smile了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_i:cmd-000131:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ab8114e3398e033d1db22a543fc5bdd7b2345771f5f68bda1891a95eb1308832",
      "text": "今后我也要用我的smile power，\n让大家都变得happy起来哦☆",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_j:cmd-000019:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b0dfa4db397f369823b420cce3489020619b9817981e6bcd95702214d399d6d6",
      "text": "开放日当天……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_j:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6f201c644523cae1a200288c7a4a84a54cde41bba2087c6401919891e84cc712",
      "text": "我是S.E.M的硲道夫。\n承蒙此次邀请，深表感谢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_j:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:eb11aa7a1454d5d332ac1daee7a40761bf72345e36cb31775427167c544c9f71",
      "text": "想必已有部分同学知晓，\n我们曾经从事教师之职。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_j:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b1515cf5cb3311003f28ffcc88f5c374ce11f7704de1c3649e236af89a17b88b",
      "text": "然而，我们过去未能将学习的乐趣\n传达给学生们。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_j:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e9dd5e3285b78d4ca8eab9bfa66d27611e326e3369b31cb37fe0d92b8d94c3e2",
      "text": "如今我们作为偶像东山再起，正在奋发勉励中。\n……正如在观众席就座的各位一样。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_j:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d1e64b3d96495d4a6692020de539c2b0de7dc4722b0a971ee7e610ca83caa39e",
      "text": "你们和我们，都是追逐梦想的同路人。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_j:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f629fe24aba4f6d8bf451a134f167453b9feb0597fd57cf81b40371f0936b7b4",
      "text": "今天，就让我们彼此分享心中的热情吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_j:cmd-000089:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:36e0a6894a9fd67d4308b74d216254ba1c2e732cedf889ecb173b246cd4558a8",
      "text": "来吧，跟上我们的节奏！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_j:cmd-000103:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:72873ebd192972f9ea05629f0074bac54b6e60359c03018ca11d86f52041389f",
      "text": "学习也好玩乐也罢，认真的表情也好快乐的表情也罢……\n全都是你人生中无可替代的宝物！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_j:cmd-000183:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:baa3e38bfdb99ac33ae033b20412b13b7f2bf0f9857158977ba573a47cb84efd",
      "text": "哦，气氛热烈起来了呢～\n大家有没有看我们的视频预习编舞啊？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_j:cmd-000198:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:91bdba91f8e2e63905c56f55764e6f9a797cc6159bc278c0aafa0766470b8313",
      "text": "各位，let's dance……啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_j:cmd-000210:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1667ef493d0199ffabbdfbf1a0df1fcfd7139bd52488350da1fc152a60ca6c43",
      "text": "（……本来打算要是出现什么不合时宜的事，\n哪怕中途也要叫停的）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_j:cmd-000212:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8f3177d598a2e795ef42fe66f3cfbdd52b98fe191e101d9f7239f5551012744d",
      "text": "（怎么回事，这首歌总觉得有种令人怀念的感觉……！？\n唔唔。身体不由自主地跟着节拍动起来了……！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_j:cmd-000224:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9b4c65ee486de47691d445b8d4c55f2a50b6c33c4f33e73ed6b71b3cb0230bc8",
      "text": "来，一起跳吧！不用烦恼啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_j:cmd-000228:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:acf3e4d39274400cbc460b786de031d7a1e376ee2177e4f4b0766d996cc9df25",
      "text": "“想去做”的心情，会为你带来happy的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_j:cmd-000232:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2b35444c4faa2093a76ef8aca6d7f2ad1121e9a63a7d2d25b78c101055770117",
      "text": "上吧！S.E.M，开始上课！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_k:cmd-000010:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "几天后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_k:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:09d44daad7ab3d7039a26e642cb272e96712b0a14af212a0e1a8b3b72f82c5de",
      "text": "Hi！大家，好久不见啦☆",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_k:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f1a8e23a2ef141e1889edf77034c6517487188a070925dd6f9f2039efa7dac33",
      "text": "喔，舞田！好久不见啊。\n直接说正事……你最近超级活跃的嘛！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_k:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:800717ec1f78b4c9061ecd3428a62dc20fef58b0c4def7f951a3d93111a7f44c",
      "text": "发行了歌曲，出演了电视剧，\n听说前阵子还在大学办了Live呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_k:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:86f5bdd55ae8de63e538c26446f55de2e6d70013048a736d2acf5749ede54508",
      "text": "是啊。我看过视频了，现场气氛超级热烈呢。\n舞田果然很适合当偶像啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_k:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6d453e49dde977048fef1f608dc944b60085db7ffa757abe4d348e8c1caff41c",
      "text": "Really？能听你们这么说真开心。\n而且，大家都有在check我的工作呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_k:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8708b75958b2e4acc2efe05e2d045f59d1c85b3ae04048ead51f38cd2f86119c",
      "text": "那是当然的。……之前看你当教师也很开心的样子，\n突然听说你要去当偶像，当时还吓了一跳呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_k:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:08a2b812a5e05a0218decedf838d6567fc7cbdef359eaa7935ad36f8d7131073",
      "text": "现在的舞田，\n感觉比以前还要更加给力了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_k:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0b2050028d1d20d7ee7961986f2ce08a5727fbf1bb1b0594b45428bd63bbd91b",
      "text": "呵呵，对吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_k:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0fcf5d72cd3eb105cbc254c6b0e10436a2daaae5fd7d7a426790cbe37d089e65",
      "text": "偶像事务所啊，\n可是能让独一无二、Unique的我，活得最像我自己的地方呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_k:cmd-000087:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b51479dc001e8f2de306a85a4581eb2d286305d73f26362f01ad811e790a261b",
      "text": "http://xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_k:cmd-000089:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:13a02cfb3328f67a3db223cbc8c7c0b0f0bd1e22d92ed2e810d109bba5c3863d",
      "text": "舞田君，这个网址是？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_k:cmd-000091:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:761c7c84dc6110e8e584060a8ad7c799f0e9014a64c85238c3a4c5c7f1fdb364",
      "text": "该不会是\n什么可疑的东西吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_k:cmd-000093:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cdd51695eb7625f39117de4d7fb9a3c10fdc414d259fd9b4da1cb52445bc37a3",
      "text": "是粉丝跳我们新歌的\n视频哦<emoji>image_talk_emoji_16</emoji>",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_k:cmd-000095:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d9797c8372c10d40c19198835912ecc2c6cc7c0934d29d668f74deb9697ecee9",
      "text": "真令人开心呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_k:cmd-000095:choice_detail:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4477693d9f871329222dc23b22a470a97c885f1ee9cfe055e73c592f309e7cee",
      "text": "居然还会上传这样的视频，\n真让人开心呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_k:cmd-000096:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7a95edc643b0313e9aa67cee02a004440593a86e860432098e421a873e21b916",
      "text": "真希望它能流行起来呢",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_k:cmd-000096:choice_detail:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:58f2fd5f8d5ba6338e48f855847bdbe2792e9f16649669814fdd82e80303abd8",
      "text": "这样能成为认识S.E.M的契机，\n真希望它能流行起来呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_k:cmd-000100:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a0e1468635f4a7a4f27b9dd0a51892d81be4a674e775468a536bd8c888079a21",
      "text": "是啊～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_k:cmd-000102:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3ff317daf3a6c4155a179ec6f084f94da308d0cd403be2454dfb8e4a4d7f1c03",
      "text": "多亏了这个孩子，要是S.E.M的\n知名度打开了，\n会有更多工作找上门来吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_k:cmd-000104:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5f3d4c6f5d1f87734d6840c6ad3d71c6b7e0d6de1863b47ebd6b8f63c92cf50f",
      "text": "要是那样就so good了！\n我想尝试各种各样的工作<emoji>image_talk_emoji_05</emoji>",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_k:cmd-000106:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:53a03eb798cba8e76afe691388147cc48b4de9ce8e015a59f91a9720055d6808",
      "text": "正是因为有这些粉丝的存在，\n我们才能作为偶像活动。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10012_01:1_3_10012_01_k:cmd-000108:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:904ab151d7a3d5bc610bed6376987aeeaeff166509ca200d2ad745df6b874f51",
      "text": "为了不忘记感恩之心，\n等敲定新工作后，\n我们再把这个视频看一遍吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
